TI  - Perioperative Use of a β-adrenergic Blocker, Propranolol, and a COX2 Inhibitor, Etodolac, in Patients Undergoing Resection With Curative Intent for Primary Colon and Rectal Cancer: Effect on Tumor Recurrence and Survival
