ST  - Dopamine Modulation of Motivation and Motor Function in Major Depression & Inflammation (MOTIVADE)
TI  - Effects of Pharmacological Dopamine Modulation on Motivation and Motor Function in Major Depression Characterized by Low-grade Inflammation.
