AB  - · To examine whether minocycline treatment will improve cognitive performance after 24 weeks compared to baseline
AB  - Secondary Objectives:
AB  - - To examine whether minocycline treatment for 24 weeks is safe and well-tolerated in individuals with HIV-associated cognitive impairment
AB  - - To examine whether minocycline treatment for 48 weeks is safe and well-tolerated in individuals with HIV-associated cognitive impairment
