ST  - Nabilone Use For Acute Pain in Inflammatory Bowel Disease Patients
TI  - Nabilone Use for Acute Pain in Inflammatory Bowel Disease Patients With Chronic Opioid Use Undergoing Gastrointestinal Surgery: A Single-centered Randomized Controlled Trial
