ST  - Methylprednisolone in Patients With Cognitive Deficits in Post-COVID-19 Syndrome (PCS)
TI  - Phase 2a, Double-blind, Randomized, Placebo-controlled Trial of Methylprednisolone Versus Placebo in Patients With Cognitive Deficits in Post-COVID-19 Syndrome (PCS)
