AB  - The purpose of this study is to establish pharmacodynamics (PD), pharmacokinetics (PK), and adverse event (AE) profile of OPC-34712 administered to schizophrenic/schizoaffective subjects. The goals of this trial are three-fold:
AB  - - To determine the effect of OPC-34712 on the individual QT interval (QTcI) corrected for placebo
